     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,</div><div><br></div><div>How to use italic fonts for the clade label via geom_cladelabel ? Is there any specific option ?</div><div><br></div><div>Best regard,</div><div>Noppol.<br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "FutItrJTBgAJ",
