   "author": "cec41188340e8212",
   "date": "2019-01-03T08:06:58Z",
   "subject": "Re: geom_cladelabel with italic fonts",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">try:</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248)\">set.seed(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">123</span>)\r\ntr &lt;- rtree(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">30</span>)\r\nggtree(tr) + xlim(<span>NA</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">5</span>) +\r\n     geom_cladelabel(node=<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">41</span>, label=<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&#39;italic(abc)&#39;</span>, parse=<span>T</span>)\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">and also examples in <a href=\"https://guangchuangyu.github.io/software/ggtree/faq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://guangchuangyu.github.io/software/ggtree/faq/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792481252335000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ZUq3A6GYmJt_nMQ89GoB4\">https://guangchuangyu.github.io/software/ggtree/faq/</a>.</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdiBkaXI9Imx0ciI+PGRpdiBkaXI9Imx0ciI+PGRpdiBkaXI9Imx0ciI+PGRpdj48ZGl2PnRy\r\neTo8L2Rpdj48ZGl2Pjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PmBgYHI8L2Rpdj48ZGl2PnNldC5zZWVkKDEyMyk8\r\nL2Rpdj48ZGl2PnRyICZsdDstIHJ0cmVlKDMwKTwvZGl2PjxkaXY+Z2d0cmVlKHRyKSArIHhsaW0o\r\nTkEsIDUpICs8L2Rpdj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PiZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7Z2VvbV9jbGFkZWxh\r\nYmVsKG5vZGU9NDEsIGxhYmVsPSdpdGFsaWMoYWJjKScsIHBhcnNlPVQpPC9kaXY+PGRpdj5gYGA8\r\nL2Rpdj48ZGl2Pjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PmFuZCBhbHNvIGV4YW1wbGVzIGluICZsdDtodHRwczo